                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The corundumite uses Cold Ray or Fire Ray and then Flies in a straight line in a direction perpendicular to its ray. During this movement, the ray moves with the corundumite. When the ray enters a creature's space, that creature is affected by the ray. The corundumite can't use Raking Shot again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Raking Shot]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
